# README update

- **`CHANGELOG.md`** — every release entry (`## vX.Y.Z`, newest first).
- **`README.md`** — short overview, under 150 lines, `**Current version:**`.
- **`DEVELOPER.md`** — technical documentation.

Default bump is patch +0.0.1. Reset `## Unreleased` to `- (none)`.
